~D. Ignore the reporter concern because video is more important than clarity.#Not correct. Step 1: reread the embedded source and identify the deadline, team role, accuracy issue, conflict, or publication need. Step 2: compare this option with the lesson model. This option is weak because it skips verification, ignores a deadline, weakens teamwork, breaks package cohesion, or prioritizes preference over audience need.
}
